{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8028ed1d-901f-8dc7-b895-33f630b8db5b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T16:12:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Richard Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:08:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hello, yes, good afternoon. Sure, thank you for picking up. I need a replacement recycling bin, if that's something you handle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:08:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can do that. What happened to the old one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's gone. Absolutely gone. The truck came last Thursday, and I think the fella tossed the bin in with the rest, or the wind took it, I don't know. Either way it's not there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:08:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it the blue one with the lid, or the open crate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:08:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The blue one, yes, of course, with the lid. Big thing. Sixty-some gallons, I'd guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's the address where it needs to go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:09:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "279 Kingston Avenue. Up on the Hill, not far from the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "279 Kingston. Perfect. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:09:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Richard Tillinghast. T-I-L-L-I, then nghast. Sure, sure, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:09:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Tillinghast. Now I'll put in the request for a new bin. Normally they get delivered within a week or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week or two. Sure. Well, here's the thing, this is the second time I've asked. I called about three weeks ago and somebody said it'd be taken care of, and, well, here I am. Nothing came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:09:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Let me look. I don't see a request under that address, so it may not have been entered. I'm sorry about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:09:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, of course, these things happen. But it's a hassle, I'll tell you. I've been stacking my cardboard in the hall for weeks, and with the holidays it's all boxes now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:10:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll get this one in today and mark it as a repeat request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:10:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'd appreciate that. And, um, would it be possible for a supervisor to call me back? Not to make trouble, just so somebody knows the first one fell through the cracks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:10:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'll leave a message for the supervisor. Is the best number 401-555-0158?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:10:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it, that's the landline. Though I may not be home all day. I'm a freelance photographer, you see, and I'm between two bookings right now, so I'm in and out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:10:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there a better time of day to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:10:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mornings are best. Sure, anytime before noon. After that I'm usually out with the camera, or running around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mornings, then. I'll write that in. The supervisor's office will probably reach you tomorrow or the day after, though with the holiday week it could stretch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, absolutely, I understand. Christmas and all. Just so long as somebody calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They will. And in the meantime, if you have extra recycling you can bring it out in a clear bag or a cardboard box next to the bin spot, and the crews usually take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, is that right? Sure, I can do that. Boxes flattened, I assume."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Flattened and tied up if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Well, thank you, Denise. I appreciate it, though I'll believe the bin when I see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Have a good afternoon, Mr. Tillinghast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:12:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
